sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe Inference Logger
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh Agent
    participant HealthApp as Health/Consumer Server<br/>0.0.0.0:8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>PVC/HDF5 or MariaDB
    participant Scheduler as PrometheusScheduler<br/>asyncio (30s)
    participant PromRegistry as prometheus-client<br/>In-Memory Registry
    participant PromEndpoint as /q/metrics Endpoint<br/>127.0.0.1:8081/TCP
    participant KubeRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Server
    participant Client as Client<br/>Dashboard / CLI

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over KServe,Storage: Flow 1: KServe Inference Payload Ingestion
        KServe->>HealthApp: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
        HealthApp->>Storage: Write inference data<br/>File I/O or MySQL/3306
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
        Note over ModelMesh,Storage: Flow 2: ModelMesh Inference Payload Ingestion
        ModelMesh->>HealthApp: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>8080/TCP HTTP, No Auth
        HealthApp->>Storage: Write inference data<br/>File I/O or MySQL/3306
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Scheduler,Prometheus: Flow 3: Metric Computation & Prometheus Publishing
        loop Every 30 seconds (configurable)
            Scheduler->>Storage: Read latest inference batch<br/>File I/O or MySQL/3306
            Storage-->>Scheduler: Inference data
            Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute registered metrics<br/>(drift, fairness, batch)
            Scheduler->>PromRegistry: Update Prometheus gauges
        end
        Prometheus->>KubeRBAC: GET /q/metrics<br/>kube-rbac-proxy auth
        KubeRBAC->>PromEndpoint: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP/8081
        PromEndpoint-->>KubeRBAC: Metrics response
        KubeRBAC-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,Storage: Flow 4: User API Request (via kube-rbac-proxy)
        Client->>KubeRBAC: POST /metrics/drift/kstest<br/>HTTPS, OAuth Bearer
        KubeRBAC->>KubeRBAC: Validate token<br/>against Kubernetes API
        KubeRBAC->>PromEndpoint: Forward to main app<br/>HTTP/8081, identity forwarded
        PromEndpoint->>Storage: Read inference data<br/>File I/O or MySQL/3306
        Storage-->>PromEndpoint: Data
        PromEndpoint->>PromEndpoint: Compute metric
        PromEndpoint-->>KubeRBAC: JSON result
        KubeRBAC-->>Client: JSON result
    end
